@page "/about"
<PageTitle>About — Free Library</PageTitle>
<h1 class="firstHeading">About Free Library</h1>
<p>Free Library is a static website: the whole catalogue is loaded once into your browser, so
   searching and browsing are instant. The only server work happens when you press
   <i>Download PDF</i>: a tiny function counts the download and sends you to a temporary
   (5-minute) link for the file.</p>
<p>There are no accounts, no cookies and no tracking beyond the anonymous download counter.</p>
